<article class="cs-card"><a class="cs-cover" href="https://yarus-vercel.vercel.app/strata/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="STRATA — open website"></a><span class="cpt-b">Concept</span><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/case-strata.webp" srcset="/assets/case-strata-900.webp 900w, /assets/case-strata.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1023px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="STRATA — Class A office tower landing page" class="case-img" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3" /><div style="margin-top: 18px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px"><p class="tu">STRATA</p><p class="bd sm mut-l">Class A office tower, Kyiv</p></div><div style="margin-top: 12px; display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap"><span class="cs-tag">Concept</span><span class="cs-tag">Commercial real estate</span><span class="cs-tag">Investor landing page</span></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div class="cs-row"><p class="bd sm mut-l">Task</p><p class="bd" style="margin-top: 4px">Bring investors and tenants to request the investment memorandum of a 34-storey office tower before the public sales launch.</p></div><div class="cs-row"><p class="bd sm mut-l">What we did</p><p class="bd" style="margin-top: 4px">Structure and copy, art direction, design and front-end: a first screen with trust arguments, floors and layouts, an investment section, a memorandum request.</p></div></div><span class="cs-open" aria-hidden="true">Open website<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8"></path></svg></span></article>
